+   The count is worked out from the screen rather than fixed: enough buyers
+   that the biggest pile nearly fills the height between the market and the
+   shelf, whatever the phone. A pile has to be tall enough that the one beside
+   it is visibly shorter — that comparison is the only thing a pile is for. */
